Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.05,0:04:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,《大雄的新魔界大冒险》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.69,0:00:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旅行者5号毁灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 被那个神秘天体的重力吸附
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给吞噬掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么远的距离也能吸过去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它拥有相对巨大的质量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是那个天体正在朝地球逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去的话 地球就一定会...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的末日吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:01:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旅行者最后传送的影像 已经解析出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们应该马上可以看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:05.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.27,0:01:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.69,0:01:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切换到大屏幕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影像现在播放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.69,0:01:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比君
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 真够戗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底要我说多少遍 你才能明白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是考出这种分数来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得害羞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给听着 你对学习的重要性 根本就没有正确的认识
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓学习算术啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不像有些说的那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么只要会对数字加加减减
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.65,0:02:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在要我下去吗？ - 其实根本就不是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我们为什么要学习解开难题呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点儿下来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 其实解开难题 - 你们先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师在跟我谈话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上就下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对事物的思考方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说你现在缺乏的就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比君
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来 我来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出局 比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个混球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:02:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:04.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你说了多少遍，你还是一点儿都没有收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天你给我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部收拾干净
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则就不许吃晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我们现在正在分析数据
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问这个天体的前进路线是怎样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位的担心 我十分理解 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在正在积极收集数据
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行分析 我认为有必要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对其做出更为透彻的分解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你房间收拾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要冷静啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法少女 魔美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是可爱的魔美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔美魔美 RURUNBA KURURINBA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:05:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把房间变干净
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么作业也拜托了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们去打比赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,球棒君 今天也拜托你了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:23.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猪猪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出门喽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您走好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有魔法就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本没什么魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去那些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:03.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被称为魔法的 不可思议的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.41,0:07:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的依靠现代科学都被解释清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓魔法 其实就是迷信
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都回到原来地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷信已经被彻底铲除了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在可是科学的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 什么科学啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是魔法更发达该有多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能使用魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一定比现在方便多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要一句咒语 一切搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿的 就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从天而降
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.26,0:08:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是把什么东西给弄坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易才收拾好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.25,0:08:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是收拾得很干净嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 小夫和胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在空地那儿欺负大雄呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欺负我？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才输了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的石像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.20,0:09:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个傻透了的石像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种东西可不能随便丢在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的是呀 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么块大石头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带回家又会因为垃圾多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而挨骂的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么是垃圾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是我的石像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是谁干的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.45,0:09:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说做得还真像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直像真的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是看到了什么可怕的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样僵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:09:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难不成这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是被魔法变成了石头的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么傻话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是那样的话 现在的你和我是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了 没有魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过也是 从天而降的确有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快来 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石像出汗了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要来台风了 刚才电视上说的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不是汗 只是要下雨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是奇怪的说话声
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是爸爸在说梦话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.53,0:11:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是后门没有关好而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 是吗 那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有人在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是什么 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么深更半夜的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子他妈 他妈 在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们自己进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明明放在院子里了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别胡说八道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.99,0:12:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石头怎么可能走路呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深更半夜的 搞这种恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快给我处理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然让我们处理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面在下大暴雨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只好先放到我的口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个好像和刚才的姿势不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快给我睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 是 是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是很怪吗 那些石像
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是很怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天再说吧 我实在太困了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我放心不下 睡不着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.48,0:13:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你想点开心的事 就能睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开心的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能使用魔法的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总觉得只要我下点工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就应该可以使用魔法了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个不开窍的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法根本就不存在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.07,0:13:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才我正好想到一个好点子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我 又想不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.81,0:13:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么来着 真让人着急
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也别吵醒我了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼 疼 疼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的肚子突然…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得回到22世纪去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.21,0:14:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的石像
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白天吃了那三十多个铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:32.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 肚子 我的肚子…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点儿不疼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天净是些奇怪的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我 放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是因为不好好接受体检
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才发生这种事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点儿 听话给我进去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枕头 浮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我说我会用魔法的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说不疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能说没毛病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦这个不爱去医院的毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得改改了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的肚子没事了吗 - 疼 疼 疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了 什么毛病都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是吃的太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么 是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我终于想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才跟你说得那个好点子了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是"如意电话亭"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我打通电话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能让幻想世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成现实的电话亭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个能行的通吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.83,0:16:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 试一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就到魔法世界去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来好像不错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你才会动动你的脑子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如意电话亭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能玩一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感受到魔法的乐趣就马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.99,0:17:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我们就可以使用魔法了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机小坐垫 现在起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔美 魔美 RURUNBA KURURINBA
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铜锣铜锣烧出来 KURURINBA
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是咒语有问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄 RURUNBA KURURINBA
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布拉 卡布拉 出来啊 铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.41,0:17:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小坐垫快飞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 铜锣烧 给我铜锣烧 铜锣烧 - 小坐垫快飞… 小坐垫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纹丝不动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的这些工具总是派不上用场
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就跟你说过没有什么魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成果子狸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成小蚯蚓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成毛毛虫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成蝗虫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成胖猪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成跳蚤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.97,0:17:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成大石头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻乎乎的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.13,0:18:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天净是些奇怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大魔王大人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都是什么人哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们哪 都是为了打败我大魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而即将来到魔界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是些自作聪明的地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美秋莎让我看看你的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雨好像已经停了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大…大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼 疼…疼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快起床 快起床
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点儿 快 快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是魔法的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI 快点儿吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.75,0:20:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.81,0:20:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能迟到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要坐上飞毯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.62,0:20:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一飞不就到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你是睡晕头了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞毯那样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们家可没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不着买那么贵的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要快点儿学会骑扫帚上学啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你连这么简单的都不会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,物体浮游术
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是魔法的基础啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 你来试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情要放轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念咒语"CHINKARAHOI"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师 让我来做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,HOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,HOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,HOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,HOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,HOI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.55,0:21:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个飞不起来的没用东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小优快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.99,0:21:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咪咪等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听了老师说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真恨不得找个地洞钻进去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,物体浮游术
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是基础中的基础啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你连魔法都不会使用的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.17,0:21:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底哪个学校能…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和原来世界没有任何的改变嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.95,0:22:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.15,0:22:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 魔法和学习是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来好像不努力的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.79,0:22:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也一样掌握不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会使用魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为我们没有学习过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.43,0:22:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是回到原来的世界去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.78,0:22:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 大雄 我们去游扫帚河吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.35,0:22:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游扫帚河
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.19,0:22:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是游车河的扫帚版吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸他给我买了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德国制造的最新的扫帚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.75,0:22:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外观漂亮就不用说了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.06,0:22:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种随心所欲的操纵感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.20,0:22:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还安装了防滑的减震坐椅
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.97,0:22:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 只骑一次的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.57,0:22:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以让你骑骑看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:22:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 不行啊 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.31,0:23:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 他是不会骑扫帚的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 是啊 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还来你这里 还真是为难你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 来吧 我们还是快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.99,0:23:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.15,0:23:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 这两个人做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管在哪个世界都是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.19,0:23:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还是变回原来的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易才来到魔法世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.77,0:23:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要一个就行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.55,0:23:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕是简单的也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就让我学一个魔法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.78,0:23:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是难得一见的上进心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.29,0:23:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行 不能这么用力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再冷静一些
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.49,0:23:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要放弃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才有一颗灰尘动了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.53,0:23:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.33,0:24:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.30,0:24:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.40,0:24:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点儿不动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.74,0:24:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不能心急啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.33,0:24:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要清除所有杂念
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.98,0:24:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深深地深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.35,0:24:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就一心想着
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.22,0:24:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要娃娃浮起来的事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.85,0:24:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浮起来 浮起来 CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.29,0:24:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浮起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.27,0:24:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见了裙子好像动了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.54,0:24:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.88,0:24:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果轻的东西 好像可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.78,0:24:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.74,0:24:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.18,0:24:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.45,0:24:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.63,0:25:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起啊 不小心玩过了头 - 对不起啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.23,0:25:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.48,0:25:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不理你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.62,0:25:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是有意的 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.72,0:25:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.58,0:25:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 静香请原谅我们 - 还请原谅我们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.17,0:25:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 求求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.55,0:25:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保证下次不会了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.07,0:25:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.30,0:25:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你原谅我们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.11,0:25:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是流星吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.48,0:25:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有黑色的流星哪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.06,0:25:35.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.68,0:25:41.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.78,0:25:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.90,0:25:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.44,0:25:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.48,0:25:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.95,0:25:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.32,0:26:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好幸福啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.13,0:26:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关键是平衡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 平衡 平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.13,0:26:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦的那个真是奇特的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.06,0:26:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不是魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.82,0:26:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是依靠科学力量的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.33,0:26:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超小型竹蜻蜓飞行器
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.87,0:26:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.57,0:26:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么科学啊 全是迷信
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.50,0:26:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这是魔法文明的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.55,0:26:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 全都烂掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.19,0:26:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一带全都枯萎了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.82,0:26:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞成这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那颗流星 一定是来者不善哪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.96,0:26:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.83,0:26:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像陨石什么的 没有找到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.96,0:26:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.70,0:26:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.57,0:26:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么在动
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.07,0:26:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.21,0:26:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.75,0:27:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是猴子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.48,0:27:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住它 我们两面夹击
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好严重 这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.89,0:27:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都是那颗流星造成的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.83,0:27:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这看起来不是一颗普通的流星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.50,0:27:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.58,0:27:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.51,0:27:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.39,0:27:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.13,0:27:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.68,0:28:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.65,0:28:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.16,0:28:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压死我了 让开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.30,0:28:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.00,0:28:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被你压扁了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼 好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.78,0:28:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后还是掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.71,0:28:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 能站吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.75,0:28:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.66,0:28:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救了他们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.42,0:28:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个怎么也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.68,0:28:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.93,0:28:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你们都没受伤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:29:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没事 大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.23,0:29:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才你驾驶的飞毯 太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.34,0:29:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 别小看我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.14,0:29:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞毯的驾驶我可是A级驾照哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.21,0:29:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.05,0:29:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.69,0:29:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.39,0:29:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了 这种大地震
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.09,0:29:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天有 前天也有过
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.88,0:29:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近一直是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这到底是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.10,0:29:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界末日就要到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别胡说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.80,0:29:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.57,0:29:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上离开这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.24,0:29:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里到处都充满了怪异的气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.04,0:29:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这片森林全都枯萎了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.25,0:29:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它遭受了某种强烈的魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.18,0:29:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里呆下去会有危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.16,0:30:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的德国制造
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.00,0:30:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的也 没 没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.47,0:30:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 大家都坐我的飞毯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.15,0:30:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.88,0:30:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别紧张 他们是我的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.11,0:31:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好厉害的警卫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.55,0:31:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了对付魔物而设置的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.69,0:31:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔物
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.99,0:31:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 最近地震和异常的天气越来越多
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.30,0:31:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为魔界星在靠近我们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.07,0:31:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸说的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么魔界星
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.41,0:31:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一片漆黑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.99,0:31:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.92,0:31:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.86,0:31:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟魔物交锋只受了这么一点伤
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.33,0:31:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真是幸运啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.07,0:31:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你们处理下伤口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请到里面的房间来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.14,0:31:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.91,0:31:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.51,0:32:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是在下 我就是满月
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.22,0:32:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.56,0:32:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 这个满月牧师是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.32,0:32:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 你不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.15,0:32:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是著名的魔法学研究者
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.12,0:32:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是经常上电视的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.89,0:32:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.99,0:32:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你啊 真是健忘
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.00,0:32:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.47,0:32:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您刚才说到的那个魔物
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.53,0:32:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和之前我们看到的黑色的流星
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.73,0:32:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和魔界星有什么关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.06,0:32:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这地球上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.48,0:32:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正要发生一件很可怕的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.79,0:32:44.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家相信恶魔的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.46,0:32:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.89,0:32:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是随着人类进化的排挤
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:50.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而灭绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.12,0:32:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都这么说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.20,0:32:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我解读了一些古代的文书
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.97,0:32:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现了一个非常可怕的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.87,0:33:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据书上记载
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.48,0:33:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们人类原本是接受了恶魔的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.75,0:33:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才建立起今天这样的魔法文明的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.68,0:33:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那些恶魔一族
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.92,0:33:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是地球上的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.25,0:33:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是从一个叫做魔界星的天体
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.88,0:33:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来到地球的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.86,0:33:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就 就是说恶魔都是外星人了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.38,0:33:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们吃惊是正常的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.70,0:33:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是在历史上
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.73,0:33:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个魔界星已经几次接近地球了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.67,0:33:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐龙的灭绝
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.21,0:33:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺亚方舟大洪水的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.67,0:33:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些让地球上所有生命
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.55,0:33:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面临灭绝危险的异常变化
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.22,0:33:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是 都是因为这个魔界星
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.28,0:33:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接近地球而发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.16,0:33:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更糟的是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.12,0:33:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这个魔界星正又一次接近地球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.66,0:34:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 不管我怎么去警告
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人愿相信魔界星和恶魔的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.80,0:34:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是一个事实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.67,0:34:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果等我们用眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.31,0:34:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以看到这个魔界星的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.19,0:34:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.25,0:34:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是妈妈是相信您的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.02,0:34:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 别再提你妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.29,0:34:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 妈妈她
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.89,0:34:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论她是为了救什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.56,0:34:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去借用恶魔的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.23,0:34:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是绝对不能原谅的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.53,0:34:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不觉 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.00,0:34:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧 对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.97,0:34:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.34,0:34:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.77,0:34:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我再去倒一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.74,0:34:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.15,0:34:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.25,0:34:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问 美夜子的妈妈她是…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.66,0:35:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子的妈妈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.93,0:35:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾 依靠现在的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.66,0:35:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没办法挽救你孩子的生命了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.80,0:35:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.87,0:35:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗人 骗人的 美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.32,0:35:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手 你在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.20,0:35:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能掌握更有力量的魔法的话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.29,0:35:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 她…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.33,0:35:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和恶魔进行交易的话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.30,0:35:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅会牺牲其他人的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.37,0:35:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且没人知道会发生什么后果
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.48,0:35:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还是和恶魔交换了协议
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.18,0:35:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用她自己的生命作祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.22,0:36:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.80,0:36:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕这件事就是把魔界星
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.23,0:36:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次招惹到地球的导火线吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.18,0:36:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔真的会来地球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.98,0:36:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没有能赶走恶魔的方法了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.15,0:36:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能说没有
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.22,0:36:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说在距今五千多年前
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.55,0:36:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个叫纳尔尼亚迪斯的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.85,0:36:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他把恶魔一族的力量都封印起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.13,0:36:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古代文献记载
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.06,0:36:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界历程一书中 记录了它的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.79,0:36:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这本书就藏在地球上的某个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.97,0:36:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说只要找到了魔界历程
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.61,0:36:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就不用害怕恶魔了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.01,0:37:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是这个文献太古老了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.38,0:37:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那本书的隐藏地点没办法解读出来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.28,0:37:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解读
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻译魔芋
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.99,0:37:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.75,0:37:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您吃点这个试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.83,0:37:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔芋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.98,0:37:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧 吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.99,0:37:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.82,0:37:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了 能看懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.17,0:37:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的魔法真是太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.28,0:37:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么不可思议的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.30,0:37:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是第一次看到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.22,0:37:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.09,0:37:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就是恶魔来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.42,0:37:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不用害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.53,0:37:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.53,0:37:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.83,0:37:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多我们也该回到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.29,0:37:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来的世界去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.57,0:37:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 飞毯也坐过了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.32,0:37:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法也总算会用了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.77,0:38:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说掀人家裙子的那招儿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.17,0:38:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是物体浮游术
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.91,0:38:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来在这儿的"如意电话亭"呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.15,0:38:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的是那个大箱子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.42,0:38:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在太碍事了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.00,0:38:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正发愁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.22,0:38:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好回收垃圾的飞毯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.89,0:38:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从咱们家这儿经过 所以我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.53,0:38:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.59,0:38:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.98,0:38:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有"如意电话亭"的话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.98,0:38:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没办法回到原来的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.79,0:38:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说不负责任的话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.56,0:38:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.09,0:38:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你要创造这世界的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.39,0:38:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该你负责任
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.68,0:38:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁把电话亭就放在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.57,0:38:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不收起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.36,0:38:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不也是
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.43,0:39:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用完的东西从来不收的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.52,0:39:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个"如意电话亭"的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.49,0:39:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁想出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.66,0:39:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是也说这是个好主意的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.56,0:39:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢 是你求我的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.04,0:39:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次跟你来其它的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.46,0:39:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.05,0:39:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比昨天又变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.92,0:39:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它吸走了其它星星的光
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.77,0:39:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界星越来越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.93,0:39:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.86,0:39:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.16,0:39:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我终于明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.00,0:39:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依靠这个就能找到魔界历程了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.10,0:39:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.29,0:39:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来看 就在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.41,0:39:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.47,0:39:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.42,0:39:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 又吵架了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.22,0:39:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 说是又要来台风了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.36,0:40:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 这儿发洪水 那儿来寒流的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.56,0:40:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.39,0:40:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.86,0:40:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.61,0:40:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.82,0:41:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快…快到桌子底下去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.19,0:41:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.58,0:41:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好严重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.51,0:41:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,震源一定离得很近吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.32,0:41:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电视机…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.29,0:41:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让开
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.58,0:41:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让开
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.59,0:41:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开不开
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.12,0:41:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.72,0:41:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了电视机是怎么开了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.26,0:41:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先放在开关上 然后输入念力
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.90,0:41:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超大型的台风强度没有丝毫减弱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.37,0:41:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在继续向北挺进
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.23,0:41:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是 嗯 下面播报
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.66,0:41:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚发生的地震的详细报道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.91,0:41:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,震源地是树海森林西北部
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.74,0:41:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为震源深度非常浅
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.18,0:42:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果真是离我们这儿非常近啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.66,0:42:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到树海森林
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.08,0:42:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是美夜子小姐教会的附近
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.91,0:42:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.02,0:42:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.22,0:42:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.13,0:42:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.06,0:42:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你耍赖 自私自利 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.01,0:42:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.14,0:42:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卑鄙 无耻的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.80,0:42:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么丢下我不管了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.96,0:42:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小短腿儿 过来 果子狸
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.45,0:42:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是…哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.97,0:42:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.12,0:42:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.71,0:43:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不介意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.24,0:43:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意跟你 跟你和好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.19,0:43:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.63,0:43:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.98,0:43:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是吵架也没有用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.03,0:43:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们齐心合力
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.74,0:43:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到原来世界的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.77,0:43:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一定能够找到的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.66,0:43:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.12,0:43:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.56,0:43:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好担心美夜子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.86,0:43:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.79,0:43:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.82,0:43:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.63,0:43:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.66,0:44:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教会消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.00,0:44:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.94,0:44:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.48,0:44:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.31,0:44:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子他们 到底怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.36,0:44:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.23,0:44:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 冷静啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.50,0:44:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.37,0:44:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦 哆啦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.64,0:44:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 龙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.52,0:44:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个是那小丫头的同伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.65,0:44:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.79,0:45:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小丫头出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.16,0:45:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.01,0:45:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.21,0:45:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.67,0:45:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.67,0:45:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.30,0:45:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.88,0:45:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回射斗篷
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.56,0:46:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.76,0:46:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好惨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.27,0:46:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起啊 连你们也被卷进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.50,0:46:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.14,0:46:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐 满月牧师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.11,0:46:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔一族把整个教会
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.33,0:46:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都带到异界空间去了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.35,0:46:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我幸运地逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.05,0:46:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那个恶魔发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.50,0:46:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直追过来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.65,0:46:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这个古代文书平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.79,0:46:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要找到了魔界历程
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.82,0:46:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就知道封印恶魔一族的方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.03,0:46:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着这个方法潜入魔界星的话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.55,0:46:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去魔界星
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.20,0:46:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们没有彻底打败大魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.33,0:46:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就必然要进攻地球
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.90,0:46:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还能救出我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.34,0:46:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了请你们帮助我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.11,0:47:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你突然跟我们说到这么可怕的事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.71,0:47:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.71,0:47:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要去魔界星吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.82,0:47:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也没说不去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.65,0:47:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧 只是现在只有我们三个人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.79,0:47:14.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能做点儿什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.25,0:47:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还是去找警察叔叔商量商量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.32,0:47:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.20,0:47:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不该再把你们两个也卷进来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.27,0:47:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我一个人的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.77,0:47:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.61,0:47:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.48,0:47:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.04,0:48:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说美夜子她一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.33,0:48:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去寻找魔界历程了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.18,0:48:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 也许是那样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.55,0:48:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.35,0:48:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 我们去了魔界星
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.00,0:48:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也毫无意义啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.35,0:48:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只会简单的物体浮游术
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.99,0:48:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和骑扫帚 难道不是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.92,0:48:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得没错 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.33,0:48:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只会成为累赘啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.52,0:48:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.30,0:48:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让美夜子一个人去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.47,0:48:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同学们 下午的课取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.30,0:48:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁着台风还没有变得更严重
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.55,0:48:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们尽快回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.24,0:48:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.67,0:48:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 小夫 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.67,0:49:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅是我们这一个地区
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.50,0:49:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界各处都在发生台风和热带气旋
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.00,0:49:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灾害情况正在不断扩大
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.66,0:49:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.03,0:49:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今后有进一步恶化的可能
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.45,0:49:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.82,0:49:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.95,0:49:20.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照目前的状况
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.98,0:49:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能发生引起全球恐慌的重大灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.28,0:49:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我国政府已设立特别领导部门
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.39,0:49:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是爸爸也能早点回家就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.77,0:49:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为要死了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.37,0:49:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世…世界末日要到了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.76,0:49:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 世界末日要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.98,0:49:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个魔界星可是越来越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.15,0:49:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.82,0:49:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.36,0:50:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像情况很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.16,0:50:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界星走到什么地方了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.10,0:50:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大地震 巨型台风
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.04,0:50:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后世界的末日
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.64,0:50:20.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比大雄先生 您的快递
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.51,0:50:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.30,0:50:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有老鼠 有老鼠 有老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.80,0:50:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.80,0:50:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鬼豆子 看招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.71,0:50:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.30,0:50:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是老鼠吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.58,0:50:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是被人诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.85,0:51:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是满月牧师的古代文书
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.37,0:51:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐送来的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.09,0:51:05.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有封信
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.29,0:51:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我发生了什么不测
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.59,0:51:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请一定要把这个用上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.36,0:51:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后还是要给你们添麻烦 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.17,0:51:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.70,0:51:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.37,0:51:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是一个人去找魔界历程了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.14,0:51:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.41,0:51:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 走吧 我们也去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.58,0:51:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们两个也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.25,0:51:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.46,0:51:35.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.56,0:51:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们下定决心了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.49,0:51:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话我是真不想去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.35,0:51:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是与其在这里等着魔界星来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.66,0:51:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不如做点什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.55,0:51:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫真是个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.00,0:51:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别落下我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.80,0:51:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.04,0:51:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.15,0:52:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定我们只会成为累赘
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.77,0:52:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是总不能就这样视而不见哪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.96,0:52:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 既然这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.35,0:52:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.90,0:52:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 就是什么魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.19,0:52:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会用的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.53,0:52:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个装饰
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.11,0:52:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 我调节下气氛嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.61,0:52:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 我们直接就跳到
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.11,0:52:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐的飞毯上 给她个惊喜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.85,0:52:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.42,0:52:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么出发喽
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.60,0:52:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.76,0:53:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不该来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.33,0:53:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手 放手 别拉我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.40,0:53:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.74,0:53:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 不要慌
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.28,0:53:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在找到洞穴之前再坚持一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.59,0:53:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.22,0:53:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界历程就在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.06,0:53:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有为了防止恶魔进入
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.95,0:53:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而设下的机关
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.56,0:53:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就在这附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.63,0:53:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪太多了 在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.50,0:53:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回射斗篷 空气炮
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.44,0:53:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 接着
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.86,0:54:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.37,0:54:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 就是那个洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.80,0:54:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.71,0:54:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来吸引它们攻击掩护你们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.77,0:54:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界历程就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.19,0:54:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.51,0:54:13.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人不行的 我也来帮忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.75,0:54:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你快来抓住我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.48,0:55:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.94,0:55:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.58,0:55:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.56,0:55:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的 CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.96,0:55:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.35,0:55:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.58,0:55:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.08,0:55:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.25,0:55:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 他们怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.59,0:56:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么放弃了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.16,0:56:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.00,0:56:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.53,0:56:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.40,0:56:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.99,0:56:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.67,0:56:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些恶魔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.76,0:56:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们哪 突然都跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.64,0:56:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是害怕魔界历程就都跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.15,0:56:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来 魔界历程呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.75,0:56:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们弄到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.86,0:56:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界历程 那我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.77,0:56:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.54,0:56:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种东西必须马上处理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.34,0:56:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们来说 这就是个祸患
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.11,0:56:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 你这家伙是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.71,0:57:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是美夜子小姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.09,0:57:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是恶魔一族
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.13,0:57:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.99,0:57:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是她也被恶魔们袭击了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.13,0:57:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是愚蠢的人类啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.86,0:57:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直都在演戏喽
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.17,0:57:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 洞穴设置的机关
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.88,0:57:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔是进不去的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.78,0:57:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你 你才会来利用我们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.66,0:57:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 你把美夜子小姐怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.85,0:57:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上要死的人没必要知道这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.03,0:58:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四季徽章 夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.14,0:58:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四季徽章 夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.31,0:58:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 竟然被那个恶魔给骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.35,0:58:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界历程也被拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.99,0:58:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那恶魔竟然化身成了美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.66,0:58:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好 还好 说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.19,0:58:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也只拿走了其中的一本
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.33,0:59:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个书啊 在这边和那边
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.66,0:59:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都各放了一本
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.10,0:59:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说一共有两本喽
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.30,0:59:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全正确
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.39,0:59:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.35,0:59:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.77,0:59:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就已经拿到了一半了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.18,0:59:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 虽然好不容易拿到了一半
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.18,0:59:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可美夜子小姐 她怎么样了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.29,0:59:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.59,0:59:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是老鼠吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.59,0:59:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪啊 从昨天开始就一直
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.17,0:59:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它戴着项圈哪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.19,0:59:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可能是谁家的宠物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.15,0:59:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 别管那些 快把它赶走啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.77,1:00:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美…美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.74,1:00:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.98,1:00:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么变成老鼠了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.77,1:00:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教会被恶魔袭击了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.28,1:00:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸他想方设法要让我逃出去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.19,1:00:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我还是给被恶魔们发现了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.38,1:00:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被变成了老鼠
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.83,1:00:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸被带去了魔界星
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.20,1:00:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我只能眼睁睁地看着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.11,1:00:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐 不要哭
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.33,1:00:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起去救满月牧师吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.31,1:00:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大家一起到魔界星去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.18,1:00:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些可恶的恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.98,1:01:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去把他们彻底消灭掉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.15,1:01:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗 你们愿意陪我去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.88,1:01:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.06,1:01:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我们找到了魔界历程
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.83,1:01:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然只是一半
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.13,1:01:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.55,1:01:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大家已经决定了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.97,1:01:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要保护地球不被恶魔破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.54,1:01:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大家一定要救出满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.66,1:01:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.99,1:01:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是 谢谢你们 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.92,1:01:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 哆啦A梦 快醒醒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.19,1:01:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有老鼠
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.33,1:01:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.00,1:01:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在大家正在给她施魔法呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.63,1:01:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然暂时没办法变回原来的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.74,1:01:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但正试着用其它的魔法让她变个样子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.81,1:02:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要 我要回家
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.57,1:02:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.89,1:02:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是一点点在变嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.22,1:02:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠又不是橡皮泥
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.45,1:02:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不都是这样子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.88,1:02:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是不要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.55,1:02:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.00,1:02:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请看
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.88,1:02:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌了 你们几个
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.71,1:02:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 好了 快把翻译魔芋拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.62,1:02:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.98,1:02:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么各位准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.99,1:02:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.36,1:02:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么向魔界星
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.56,1:02:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.51,1:03:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果真是一照到月亮的光
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.51,1:03:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法就解除啦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.88,1:03:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.08,1:03:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全被乌云包裹住了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.53,1:03:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须要阻止魔界星接近
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.97,1:03:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又变回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.77,1:03:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要打败了恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.91,1:03:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法就会解除的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.56,1:03:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么恶魔的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.04,1:03:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一见到月光就被会解除了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.01,1:03:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为月光里有能封锁恶魔魔法的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.28,1:03:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮不是一直在围着地球旋转吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.95,1:03:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了魔界历程的纳尔尼亚迪斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.99,1:03:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了保护地球
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.42,1:03:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才赋予月光这种力量的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.49,1:03:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了 月光灯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.40,1:04:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个灯的光和月光是完全一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.30,1:04:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以和恶魔作战时
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.73,1:04:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要拿着这个就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.67,1:04:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然这本来是为了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.07,1:04:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变身成狼人而使用的灯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.34,1:04:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会变成狼人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.55,1:04:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总比被变成老鼠要强多了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.98,1:04:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.23,1:04:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到你的魔法 可真神奇啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.92,1:04:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.58,1:04:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实这些都是未来的工具
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.65,1:04:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是依靠科学的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.36,1:04:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.62,1:04:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也相信科学这样的迷信吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.55,1:04:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.36,1:04:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 差不多该加快速度了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.13,1:04:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请到里面来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.00,1:04:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.44,1:04:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入口有点小 但里面很宽敞
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.31,1:04:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.11,1:04:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明在太空 但是有空气啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.38,1:04:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到现在才发现吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.38,1:04:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来魔法世界的太空
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.76,1:04:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我们那个世界的太空
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.58,1:04:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像完全不同啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.18,1:05:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.50,1:05:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.00,1:05:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超酷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.30,1:05:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是飞毯里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.44,1:05:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这儿下去的话 还有小房间
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.51,1:05:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到魔界星还要花点儿时间
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.99,1:05:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说还可以洗澡吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.35,1:05:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然啦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.00,1:05:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好幸福啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.39,1:05:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一半落在他们的手里了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.20,1:05:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可 可是他们现在都在冰层下面
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.99,1:05:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.80,1:05:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们现在正在来魔界星的路上
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.98,1:05:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.51,1:05:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要知道我本来应该取你性命的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.81,1:05:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是魔界历程最最重要的部分
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.82,1:06:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这本里只记载了一半
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.19,1:06:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你捡了条命 美秋莎
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.69,1:06:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.46,1:06:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.36,1:06:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可以吗 大魔王
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.66,1:06:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您竟然饶了美秋莎的小命
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.63,1:06:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我还有事要她去办呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.50,1:06:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我终于明白怎样解除纳尔尼亚迪斯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.70,1:06:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设下的月光魔法了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.57,1:06:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么终于可以
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.33,1:06:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个满月之夜
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.58,1:06:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球就会成为我的囊中之物了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.93,1:06:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到在飞毯里也能洗澡
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.59,1:06:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太美妙了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.73,1:06:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你可真喜欢洗澡啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.55,1:06:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那当然了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.77,1:06:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕洗上一天也不嫌多啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.11,1:06:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样会泡肿的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.68,1:07:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗 在我小的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.66,1:07:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头发也跟你现在一样长
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.33,1:07:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 为什么剪短了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.39,1:07:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得短发更适合我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.36,1:07:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊 不过美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.95,1:07:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长发时 也一定很可爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.95,1:07:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.56,1:07:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的头发从来都没有比现在短过
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.67,1:07:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最长的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.36,1:07:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比现在的头发还要再长一些呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.41,1:07:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子的头发是自然卷儿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.34,1:07:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是像谁呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.94,1:07:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.35,1:07:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 梳好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.26,1:07:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 看我 看我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.82,1:07:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.55,1:07:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈给你梳的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.35,1:07:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 妈妈梳的 可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.17,1:08:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.72,1:08:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.93,1:08:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄啊 有事吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.19,1:08:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 哆啦A梦说我们开饭了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.97,1:08:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.23,1:08:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很厉害的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.66,1:08:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有一个美食家餐桌的道具
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.99,1:08:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对它说想吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.63,1:08:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论什么马上会出现的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.34,1:08:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 我的肚子都咕咕叫了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.74,1:08:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上去吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.55,1:08:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.76,1:08:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 我 我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.43,1:09:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会尽自己所有的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.43,1:09:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会救出美夜子爸爸的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.20,1:09:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保证 所以请打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.91,1:09:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.65,1:09:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.52,1:09:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.70,1:09:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有精神了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.30,1:09:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.37,1:09:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是魔界星啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.28,1:09:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要阻止它接近地球
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.41,1:09:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就必须要打败恶魔一族的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.18,1:09:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大魔王才可以
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.22,1:09:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突破魔界星外的黑色火焰的入口
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.00,1:09:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.25,1:09:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是在南极的一个火焰裂缝
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.26,1:10:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不能在10秒内通过
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.25,1:10:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一切都将会化为灰烬
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.43,1:10:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有10秒
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.70,1:10:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们全速冲刺也不一定来得及
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.27,1:10:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里就是火焰的裂缝吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.34,1:10:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要突破重力层
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.99,1:10:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家做好抗冲击准备
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.36,1:10:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,着火了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.28,1:10:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就好 坚持一下
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.58,1:11:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.39,1:11:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备弃毯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.33,1:11:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烫 烫 烫
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.32,1:11:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.00,1:11:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快藏起来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.46,1:11:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔马上就会过来的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.78,1:11:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.92,1:11:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.32,1:11:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好冷
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.31,1:11:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦快把四季徽章拿出来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.99,1:11:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可要是冰化了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.55,1:11:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的位置就会暴露了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.66,1:11:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来完全烧毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.35,1:11:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定是地球上的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.89,1:11:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要进入魔界真是不知死活
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.90,1:11:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里面的人也一定烧成焦炭了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.15,1:12:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧 也有可能在半空中就逃脱了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.33,1:12:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须马上向大魔王汇报
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.73,1:12:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.97,1:12:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,间谍卫星正在准确地跟踪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.96,1:12:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就能找到大魔王的城堡了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.33,1:12:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们追上去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.62,1:12:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞行条件真是糟透了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.83,1:12:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手脚就快失去知觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.33,1:12:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像脑子也不好使了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.46,1:12:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以睡着啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.19,1:12:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然连心脏都冻上的话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.62,1:12:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.62,1:13:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.74,1:13:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.91,1:13:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.00,1:13:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好困哪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.83,1:13:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.58,1:13:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 跟你说了不能睡啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.33,1:13:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄 我不是说了不能睡吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.25,1:13:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好暖和
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.69,1:13:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你快睁开眼睛啊 快
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.16,1:13:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.57,1:13:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.89,1:13:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.61,1:13:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来涂那么一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.20,1:13:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会那么暖和啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.52,1:13:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了这招了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.57,1:13:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 各位稍等
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.78,1:13:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有越冷就越觉得暖和的魔法药膏
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.02,1:13:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了冷热相反霜
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.06,1:13:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都快点涂上
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.98,1:13:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快给我醒过来 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.80,1:14:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不错 涂上以后浑身暖洋洋的了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.81,1:14:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来不是做梦啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.87,1:14:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.10,1:14:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你就不能轻点儿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.63,1:14:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才过分呢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.85,1:14:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太热了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.66,1:14:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你涂得太多了 擦掉一点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.39,1:14:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 我们穿过南极了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.54,1:14:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家小心
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.94,1:14:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就到恶魔居住的大陆了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.00,1:15:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的竹蜻蜓没电了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.19,1:15:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的也是
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.13,1:15:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的也是
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.28,1:15:20.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,着陆了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.80,1:15:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是大魔王的城堡啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.07,1:15:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸也一定在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.87,1:15:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎样才能靠近啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.37,1:15:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周围可都是恶魔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.98,1:15:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.87,1:15:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神奇的鼹鼠手套
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.95,1:15:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.45,1:15:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 跟我来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.46,1:16:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.82,1:16:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请向左修正15度
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.81,1:16:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ＯＫ
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.33,1:16:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没找到
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.53,1:16:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去给我好好地找
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.33,1:16:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.24,1:16:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.68,1:16:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向右3度 向上2度
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.58,1:16:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向左2度 停
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.56,1:16:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘 我们的上面就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.22,1:17:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到现在还没发现地球人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.05,1:17:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想应该是和飞毯一起烧毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.76,1:17:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真是些有骨气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.97,1:17:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这个是
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.34,1:17:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糊弄小孩子的把戏
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.49,1:17:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看 那个就是大魔王
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.73,1:17:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打败这个大魔王的方法只有一个
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.13,1:17:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是把银制的飞镖
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.99,1:17:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插入他的心脏
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.93,1:17:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们每个人都拿两支
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.17,1:18:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.84,1:18:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月光灯也分给大家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.21,1:18:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这个盲点星
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.81,1:18:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是可以放心使用的长效新款
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.49,1:18:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 只要戴上它
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.33,1:18:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的形象就会进入对方的盲点
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.86,1:18:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盲点
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.18,1:18:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 别人就完全看不见你了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.13,1:18:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好神奇啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.76,1:18:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个我说大家都还在吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.65,1:18:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往哪摸
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.84,1:18:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我注意 可疑之物
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.77,1:18:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕一条虫也不能放过
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.95,1:18:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.75,1:18:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.06,1:18:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么 算了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.83,1:19:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 现在我们出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.64,1:19:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方好大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.53,1:19:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先找到满月牧师再说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.00,1:19:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是这么大怎么找啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.38,1:19:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.00,1:19:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一会儿上 一会儿下
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.30,1:19:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都没劲儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.49,1:19:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.30,1:19:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.06,1:19:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你安静点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.43,1:19:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪儿啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.37,1:19:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这上面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.37,1:19:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢…谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.80,1:19:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.96,1:19:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.72,1:19:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.52,1:20:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说用来关人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.20,1:20:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这房间太大了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.39,1:20:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为地球人能走到这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.35,1:20:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也真不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.66,1:20:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.17,1:20:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不是满月牧师
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.96,1:20:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他应该是看不见的 为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.75,1:20:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就凭这种小把戏吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.92,1:20:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都被我识破了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.75,1:20:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大魔王先生 请你放弃进攻地球
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.16,1:20:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.90,1:20:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 那是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.63,1:20:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要知道地球可是我们恶魔一族
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.72,1:20:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追逐了几千年的猎物
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.47,1:20:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的魅力让我无法放弃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.64,1:20:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就等死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.12,1:21:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大魔王变多了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.35,1:21:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那都只是些幻影
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.53,1:21:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.36,1:21:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.20,1:21:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不行
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.46,1:21:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个才是真的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.70,1:21:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们能力就这么一点儿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.50,1:21:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一些不中用的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.15,1:21:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.80,1:21:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.02,1:21:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.57,1:21:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成…成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.60,1:21:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么光
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.88,1:22:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快投飞镖
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.68,1:22:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.08,1:22:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.14,1:22:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.26,1:22:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞镖明明都投中了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.52,1:22:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是些雕虫小技
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.54,1:23:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次一定要抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.33,1:23:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.27,1:23:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.61,1:23:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我小心点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.07,1:23:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他们跑掉
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.82,1:23:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.19,1:23:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.73,1:23:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点藏起来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.99,1:23:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.47,1:23:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.44,1:23:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼 好疼 好疼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.50,1:23:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家先暂时撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.00,1:23:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新再想办法吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.87,1:23:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在城堡的相反方向
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.51,1:23:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了一片森林吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.31,1:23:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都戴上盲点星
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.77,1:23:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全力向那片森林冲刺吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.86,1:23:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在森林的入口处会合
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.62,1:23:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.62,1:23:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.19,1:23:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你快戴上盲点星
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.30,1:23:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.57,1:23:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.66,1:24:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.91,1:24:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.58,1:24:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.62,1:24:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.92,1:24:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.00,1:24:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么应该是看不见的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.31,1:24:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的盲点星
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.89,1:25:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.50,1:25:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.36,1:25:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经被包围了 逃不掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.47,1:25:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄把这个戴上
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.74,1:25:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在去引开这些恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.17,1:25:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快逃走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.68,1:25:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.50,1:25:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算我再怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.59,1:25:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能丢下女孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.90,1:25:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只顾自己逃走啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.05,1:25:26.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会使用魔法吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.00,1:25:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能和恶魔战斗吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.90,1:25:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们都在这儿被抓住了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.92,1:25:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁来保护地球哪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.59,1:25:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.00,1:25:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真对不起 总而言之你先逃走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.20,1:25:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我有大家和我在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.31,1:25:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.75,1:25:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以没什么可害怕的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.45,1:25:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你能跟我说
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.63,1:26:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.95,1:26:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的让我好开心
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.42,1:26:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.30,1:26:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快追啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.33,1:26:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快追
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.95,1:26:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.09,1:26:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会回来救你的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.10,1:26:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.20,1:26:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮完全红了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.17,1:26:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像血一样红
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.35,1:27:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人都没来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.35,1:27:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都被抓住了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.32,1:27:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.67,1:27:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么银飞镖会没有用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.00,1:27:22.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能有魔界历程的另一半
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.01,1:27:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许就能明白怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.52,1:27:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.25,1:27:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我制作了魔法的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.09,1:27:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才让世界变成现在这个样子的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.12,1:27:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.40,1:27:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今 就算你这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.70,1:27:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也无法挽救
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.22,1:27:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说挽救
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.30,1:27:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是有可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.90,1:27:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.99,1:27:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“如意电话亭”已经没有了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.30,1:27:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就用时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.80,1:27:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用时光机回到那一天
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.43,1:27:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就可以阻止当时的我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.49,1:27:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去使用如意电话亭啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.60,1:27:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.32,1:28:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 出来吧 取物包
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.80,1:28:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从地球上大雄的房间拿来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.94,1:28:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的书桌
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.55,1:28:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后两个家伙已经找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.30,1:28:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去追 美秋莎
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.95,1:28:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们处理掉
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.99,1:28:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.19,1:28:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到过去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.66,1:28:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到现实世界
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.25,1:28:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.44,1:28:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.85,1:28:45.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有东西
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.25,1:28:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.27,1:28:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会在这时间隧道里
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.70,1:28:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.22,1:28:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追上来了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.20,1:29:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.80,1:29:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电池没电了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.67,1:29:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我就没有想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.66,1:29:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有魔法的话 就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.24,1:29:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫帚
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.37,1:29:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不会飞呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.82,1:29:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有别的办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.00,1:29:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起飞 起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.52,1:29:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从天而降
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.91,1:29:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么呀 这个傻透了的石像
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.00,1:29:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种东西可不能随便丢在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.87,1:29:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.86,1:29:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的是呀 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.15,1:29:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么块大石头
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.00,1:30:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能动了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.32,1:30:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.07,1:30:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就要使用"如意电话亭"了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.30,1:30:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须马上制止
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.75,1:30:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿行圈 来吧 快点 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.50,1:30:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月…月亮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.63,1:30:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.40,1:30:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们自己进来的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.83,1:30:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明明放在院子里了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.56,1:30:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石头怎么可能走路呢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.57,1:30:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快给我处理掉
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.73,1:31:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.33,1:31:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可怎么办好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.70,1:31:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是月光灯啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.41,1:31:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有了这个
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.31,1:31:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.80,1:31:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.97,1:31:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 得赶快通知外面的我们啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.57,1:31:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.35,1:31:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.20,1:31:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还是先把这些东西
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.07,1:32:00.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丢来丢去 折腾一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.77,1:32:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.89,1:32:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼 疼 疼
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.20,1:32:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.26,1:32:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肚子突然…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.66,1:32:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快发现 快发现
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.00,1:32:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事 我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.83,1:32:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点发现呀
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.47,1:32:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月光灯的功效
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.75,1:32:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.50,1:32:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.27,1:32:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.25,1:33:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.80,1:33:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 魔法解除了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.93,1:33:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是在这个城堡里
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.50,1:33:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的魔法好像也被封住了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.77,1:33:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就没有办法逃出去了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.52,1:33:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是大雄和哆啦A梦他们一定会…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.05,1:33:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个已经被美秋莎的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.25,1:33:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成石像了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.72,1:33:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来地球就要是我们的了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.75,1:33:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美秋莎大人已经前去
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.40,1:33:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,削弱月亮的魔力了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.40,1:33:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.42,1:33:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要征服毫无防备的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.87,1:33:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是易如反掌啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.87,1:33:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天魔界星终于要和地球接触了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.35,1:33:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.61,1:33:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经那么近了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.55,1:33:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为庆祝会把你们做成菜肴
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.47,1:33:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就耐心等着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.30,1:33:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.43,1:34:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恢复知觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.20,1:34:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦美…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.50,1:34:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你会在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.11,1:34:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为世修他说哥哥肚子疼的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.82,1:34:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是在四次元口袋里
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.30,1:34:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就让我通过备品口袋进去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.02,1:34:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我这么一看
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.85,1:34:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就发现你们两个变成石头人了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.40,1:34:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦美…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.20,1:34:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 到底发生了什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.10,1:34:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这回可大事不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.50,1:34:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实就是这样 那样…这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.92,1:34:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.40,1:34:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这样的事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.84,1:34:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.95,1:34:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有"如意电话亭"就可以解决了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.55,1:34:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.90,1:34:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是我的好妹妹
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.64,1:34:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我们就回到原来的世界了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.37,1:34:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万岁 谢谢你了 哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.12,1:34:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.99,1:35:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"大雄的奇幻大冒险 剧终"
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.69,1:35:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.60,1:35:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我想问一下
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.35,1:35:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这取消的话
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.93,1:35:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是能回到原来的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.32,1:35:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是魔法的世界呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.98,1:35:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边的人会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.51,1:35:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.46,1:35:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是变成两个平行世界了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.35,1:35:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平…平行
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.42,1:35:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是那边是那边…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.70,1:35:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为和我们这边没有关系的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.52,1:35:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样 就那样 继续发展下去…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.80,1:35:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.57,1:35:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样可不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.03,1:35:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话 美夜子他们
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.25,1:35:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会等不到我们去救他们
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.67,1:35:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而被恶魔们…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.22,1:36:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.06,1:36:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我差一点儿 差一点儿就给忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.96,1:36:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证过的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.86,1:36:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说一定会帮美夜子小姐去救她爸爸的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.00,1:36:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发过誓
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.82,1:36:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说一定会 回去救美夜子小姐的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.80,1:36:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.58,1:36:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了去做个了结
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.07,1:36:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要吃就吃胖虎吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.10,1:36:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只有皮和骨头
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.60,1:36:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点儿都不好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.98,1:36:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要胡说了 我也只有肥肉而已
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.20,1:36:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢吃肥的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.27,1:36:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这家伙油炸了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.61,1:36:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 还是做回锅肉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.63,1:36:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是有两颗星啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.02,1:36:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还是油炸了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.25,1:36:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做白斩
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.73,1:37:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是三颗星哦
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.98,1:37:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就做白斩的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.17,1:37:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.00,1:37:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.97,1:37:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一只巨大的蓝色果子狸攻打进来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.90,1:37:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色果子狸…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.72,1:37:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.06,1:37:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.05,1:37:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.71,1:37:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.05,1:37:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来救你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.07,1:37:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是果子狸
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.18,1:37:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.27,1:37:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐变回原来的样子了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.80,1:37:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.89,1:37:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 抓紧时间
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.52,1:37:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁着哆啦美吸引住恶魔的注意力
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.13,1:37:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.33,1:38:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星星有一个 两个 三个 四个 五个…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.20,1:38:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在对不起了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.75,1:38:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.53,1:38:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞毯明明已经烧毁了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.09,1:38:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.86,1:38:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.62,1:38:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.80,1:38:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们直接飞去月亮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.52,1:38:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美秋莎正想要消除月亮的光芒呢
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.96,1:38:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.38,1:38:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 大家都到里面去
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.10,1:38:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 我们已经给飞毯涂了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.87,1:38:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷热相反霜
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.82,1:38:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些家伙正赶往月亮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.39,1:38:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美秋莎她说不定已经到了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.20,1:39:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这群可恶的地球人…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.66,1:39:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢阻挠我的计划
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.37,1:39:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人出发
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.17,1:39:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.12,1:39:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.73,1:39:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是月亮的背面了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.36,1:39:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然还有这么强大的魔力啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.70,1:39:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纳尔尼亚迪斯长久以来
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.96,1:39:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用来折磨恶魔一族的魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.37,1:39:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就让我消除它吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.98,1:39:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.74,1:39:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.50,1:39:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经太晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.95,1:39:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球已经是恶魔族的了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.18,1:39:55.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.84,1:40:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.81,1:40:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说她是…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.80,1:41:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 这不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.66,1:41:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.57,1:41:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.74,1:41:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么…怎么会这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.57,1:41:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.52,1:41:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当初我和恶魔交换协议的时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.18,1:41:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的灵魂就被恶魔给俘虏了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.02,1:41:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那以后…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.02,1:41:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就成了大魔王身边的一个恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.67,1:41:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我做了这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.26,1:41:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我只是…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.83,1:41:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是想救你…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.17,1:41:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.68,1:42:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都给我听着
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.08,1:42:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮的魔力已经解除了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.30,1:42:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凡是妨碍我们的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.03,1:42:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.46,1:42:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.42,1:42:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.65,1:42:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在魔界星…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.12,1:42:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔界星上空有一个红色的卫星
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.52,1:42:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫星 卫星怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.87,1:42:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.53,1:42:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.94,1:42:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大魔王的…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.13,1:42:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心脏…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.02,1:42:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 不要 不要离开我
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.78,1:42:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子 只要你…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.22,1:42:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能活下来…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.22,1:42:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 就满足了…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.25,1:43:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.57,1:43:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球是我们的了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.60,1:43:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.86,1:43:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美夜子小姐…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.90,1:43:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星星化作雷电把愚蠢的人类
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.65,1:43:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都击退吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.67,1:44:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快躲避
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.84,1:44:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些家伙…想往哪儿逃
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.84,1:44:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是…阻止他们前进
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.66,1:44:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是…大魔王的…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.35,1:44:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回射斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.86,1:44:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.10,1:44:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.96,1:44:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.87,1:44:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法接近
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.50,1:44:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.60,1:44:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.91,1:44:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底粉碎
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.04,1:44:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 任意门
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.32,1:44:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.22,1:45:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快投银飞镖
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.16,1:45:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 住手
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.10,1:45:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这个是最后一个
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.70,1:45:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.70,1:45:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎么不准
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.90,1:45:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么大的靶子也不可能射偏的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.35,1:45:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我住手
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.43,1:45:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快投
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.98,1:45:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放大电筒
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.50,1:45:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.22,1:47:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使如果黑暗将你包围 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.99,1:47:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我会成为你的眼眸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.59,1:47:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使如果悲伤无法言喻 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.07,1:47:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我会写成诗篇去传达 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.44,1:47:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 突然发现总是 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.31,1:47:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 用天真无邪的微笑 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.38,1:47:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在难过的时候 悄悄支持我的是你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.76,1:47:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在身边 在身边 在身边 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.60,1:47:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只有一个你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.97,1:48:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 没有人能取代 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.14,1:48:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 相信 相信 相信 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.64,1:48:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只有一个讯息 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.08,1:48:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使相隔遥远 也能传达 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.02,1:48:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.79,1:48:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 穿过熟悉亲切的城市中 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.86,1:48:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 为了去看你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.83,1:48:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 带着彼此不同的感觉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.66,1:48:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 实现奇迹的 PERFECT WORLD ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.50,1:48:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你所看到的泪水 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.53,1:48:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那令人着急 给了我坚强的决意 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.40,1:48:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 超越无数的季节 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.01,1:48:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 继续大声呼喊 你的名字 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.41,1:48:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使没有月光的夜晚 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.39,1:48:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只要有你 没有什么好害怕的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.93,1:49:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 与你走过的路 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.53,1:49:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 是无法取代的荣耀 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.27,1:49:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在身边 在身边 在身边 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.21,1:49:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只有一个你 没有人能取代 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.05,1:49:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 相信 相信 相信 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.49,1:49:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只有一个讯息 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.23,1:49:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使相隔遥远也能传达 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.43,1:49:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.23,1:49:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 别哭 别哭 别哭 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.40,1:49:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使伫足好几回 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.64,1:49:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 别将那梦想撒落 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.88,1:49:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 跌跤 跌跤 跌跤 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.62,1:49:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使迷路了路途 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.22,1:50:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只要笔直的 走下去就好 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.83,1:50:12.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使如果悲伤无法言喻 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.60,1:50:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我会写成诗篇去传达 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.12,1:50:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.02,1:50:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.52,1:50:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再把头发…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.09,1:50:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留长怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.23,1:50:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.25,1:51:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点儿…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.15,1:51:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.95,1:51:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在你前面了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.60,1:51:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可是隔壁中学的学生啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.46,1:51:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑过来跟我打架
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.80,1:51:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他们30个人搁在一块儿
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.72,1:51:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狠狠收拾了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.37,1:51:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像什么都没发生一样
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.20,1:51:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是不是只是一场梦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.24,1:51:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 我们去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.95,1:51:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CHINKARAHOI
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.75,1:51:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.16,1:51:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.27,1:51:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.50,1:51:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的风好大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.13,1:51:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你早点儿来就能看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.05,1:51:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.66,1:51:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.01,1:52:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是风吧 一定是
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.09,1:52:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 你们觉得有趣吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.69,1:52:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得明年还要来看哦
